I used AI assistance to understand the machine-learning workflow, develop and improve code, troubleshoot errors, and build the Streamlit application. I tested the application and made corrections during development.

## Limitations
This is a beginner-level educational prototype trained on a small sample dataset. Its predictions and confidence scores are not reliable enough for real-world security decisions.

